# B-337: Named-field constructor match test.
# Constructor [Ok value: a] generates [fn [value] [builtin-variant "Result.Ok" {value: value}]].
# Calling [Result.Ok value: 42] creates a variant with payload {value: 42}.
# Pattern match extracts the payload dict as `v`, then accesses `v.value`.
[
  Result: [type [let a] [Ok value: a] [Error msg: Str]]
  matched: [match [Result.Ok value: 42]
    [case [let v] [Result.Ok v]    v.value]
    [Result.Error _]:              0]
]
=== error
[E070] circular dependency detected while evaluating thunk (defined at 1:1-1:1) (materialized at 7:36-7:43)
